<title>UK: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of men's EuroLeague second</p>
<p>preliminary round basketball matches on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p>In Split: Split (Croatia) 78  Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 56</p>
<p>(halftime 36-27).</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Split - Josip Vrankovic 28, Damir Tvrdic 18, Nikola Prkacin</p>
<p>13</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen - Ufuk Sarica 11, Vasily Karasev 10, Tamer Oyguc</p>
<p>9.</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,000</p>
<p>Group G</p>
<p>In Seville: Sevilla (Spain) 78 Panathinaikos (Greece) 87</p>
<p>(47-51)</p>
<p>Group G</p>
<p>In Pau: Pau-Orthez (France) 77 Ljubljana (Slovenia) 71</p>
<p>(43-29)</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p>In Barcelona: Barcelona (Spain) 75 Partizan Belgrade</p>
<p>(Yugoslavia) 73 (38-28)</p>
</text>
